{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 14, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the news article from the Guardian, a link is provided. The rules for the Sudoku puzzle are explained, with a key exception being that the numbers in the cells contained within grey lines must add up to the figures in the corner. This unique twist adds a new layer of complexity to the traditional puzzle. The goal is to fill in the numbers without repeating any within each shape formed by the grey lines. A solution to the puzzle is promised in a future edition.\n\n\n \nAddition to the standard Sudoku rules is made with the grey lines, which require the numbers inside to sum up to the values indicated in the corners. The puzzle is presented as a challenge, with the solution to be revealed at a later time. The Observer Digital Edition is the platform where the completed puzzle will be published. Readers are invited to buy the next week's edition to see the solution. This will provide the answers to those who are struggling to solve it.\n\n\n \nThe rules of the puzzle are designed to be followed carefully, with attention to the grey lines and the numbers they contain. The sum of the numbers in these cells is crucial, as it must match the figure in the corner. This requirement adds an extra layer of difficulty, making the puzzle more engaging and challenging. The constraint that no number can be repeated within each shape adds to the complexity, requiring careful planning and attention to detail.\n\n\n \nThe opportunity to see the completed puzzle is offered to those who purchase the next week's Observer Digital Edition. This will provide a sense of accomplishment and satisfaction for those who have been working on the puzzle. The solution will reveal the correct placement of numbers, allowing readers to learn from their mistakes and improve their problem-solving skills. The puzzle is a fun and challenging way to exercise the brain, with the promise of a solution to look forward to.\n\n\n \nThe print version of the news article is available via a link, and the Sudoku puzzle is presented as a fun and challenging activity. The unique rules and constraints make it a engaging and difficult puzzle to solve. The promise of a solution in a future edition provides motivation to keep working on it, and the opportunity to learn from mistakes and improve problem-solving skills. The puzzle is a great way to spend time, exercising the brain and having fun at the same time.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.3599557876586914}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305403679609299}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.01105328369885683}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.012234875932335854}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -4.005352093372494e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0024756519123911858}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011108341626822948}, {"token": " news", "logprob": -0.9765605926513672}, {"token": " article", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " from", "logprob": -1.5019668340682983}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -2.861018856492592e-06}, {"token": " Guardian", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.036813996732234955}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.034705765545368195}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.008620785549283028}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -4.5536911784438416e-05}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.04602222517132759}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.010947994887828827}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.4225563704967499}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.02097531408071518}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.63709557056427}, {"token": " Sudoku", "logprob": -0.24465720355510712}, {"token": " puzzle", "logprob": -0.0006279165390878916}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.00084436044562608}, {"token": " explained", "logprob": -0.41893255710601807}, {"token": 